@startuml
title Case text to rubric to remedy to Rx (REP-030..038, CASE-006)
actor Doctor
participant "Case form" as CF
participant "Repertory workspace" as RW
participant "hc-repertory" as R
database "packs + user_content" as P
participant "Prescription" as RX
Doctor -> CF : selects "fear of dark, worse evening"
CF -> RW : send_to_repertory(text, visit_id)
RW -> R : search_rubrics(text)
R -> R : normalise + synonyms + abbreviations
R -> P : rubric_fts MATCH (all enabled packs)
P --> R : candidates
R --> RW : top rubrics with top5 remedies
Doctor -> RW : add rubrics, set weights, mark eliminative
RW -> R : analyse(clipboard, method)
R -> P : load remedy bitsets + grades (LRU cache)
R -> R : eliminate, score, cover, sort
R --> RW : results (< 300 ms)
RW --> Doctor : grid / list / graph
Doctor -> RW : "Prescribe Sulphur"
RW -> R : save snapshot(analysis)
RW -> RX : prefill remedy
Doctor -> RX : potency 200C, dose, print
@enduml
